notes = "(!) Load a game's MAME set: airtrix, airtrixo, braveff, pharrier, sgnascar, sgnascaro, swracer or von4 (.zip, .7z).|(!) The shared sets hikaru.zip and mie.zip go beside the game or in system/odin.|(!) Needs RetroArch's glcore video driver (OpenGL 4.3)."
description = "Odin, the low-level emulator of the SEGA Hikaru arcade board, as a libretro core. It runs the programs of the real chips and draws the board's 3D with OpenGL, at up to six times its resolution. It plays Air Trix, Brave Firefighters, Planet Harriers, NASCAR Arcade, Star Wars Racer Arcade and Cyber Troopers Virtual-On Force."
